					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-460051#post-1413671</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-460051/dichotomy#post-1413671</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 10 Apr 2012 17:09:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TL333s</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1304786</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I took it as an indication of the style. Note the long paragraphs separated by single lines in the tense and wholly personal first part, followed by more evenly spaced paragraphs once the second character appears to cut the tension. It's visually very pleasing, though I found myself scanning the short lines involuntarily, which made the longer paragraphs all the more tense.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
